  "term_and_condition": "<h2>Aromantic Ltd Affiliate Programme Terms and Conditions</h2><p>Welcome to Aromantic Ltd. By joining our Affiliate Programme, you agree to the following Terms and Conditions. These apply to Aromantic Ltd (“we”, “us”, “merchant”) and you as an Affiliate (“you”, “affiliate”).</p><p>Participation in the Programme constitutes full acceptance of these Terms. If you do not agree, you must not register or participate.</p><hr><h3>1. Approval of Registration</h3><p>We reserve the absolute right to approve or reject any Affiliate application at our sole discretion. No reason is required to be provided, and no legal claim may be made against Aromantic Ltd in relation to rejection or removal.</p><hr><h3>2. Affiliate Links, Coupons and Attribution</h3><p>Affiliate links are automatically generated within the dashboard. You may also generate links to specific products or collections.</p><p>Attribution rules:</p><ul><li><p>If a customer clicks multiple affiliate links, the <strong>last link clicked</strong> will receive the commission.</p></li><li><p>Affiliates may be issued a coupon code. Coupon usage and eligibility are shown in the dashboard.</p></li><li><p>Commission is paid once only per order. Using both a link and a coupon does not generate double commission.</p></li><li><p>If you are not assigned a branded coupon, you are not permitted to promote any Aromantic coupon.</p></li></ul><p>Affiliates may promote via websites, social media, email marketing, blogs, magazines and offline advertising, <strong>except for restricted channels listed below</strong>.</p><hr><h3>3. Restricted Promotion Methods</h3><p>The following are <strong>strictly prohibited</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Google Ads, Bing Ads, shopping ads, brand bidding or any paid search advertising using Aromantic brand terms, product names, or close variations.</p></li><li><p>Any paid advertising that competes with Aromantic’s own advertising channels.</p></li><li><p>Misleading claims, medical claims, or misrepresentation of products.</p></li><li><p>Impersonation of Aromantic staff or official channels.</p></li></ul><p>Violation of these rules will result in immediate removal from the programme and forfeiture of unpaid commissions.</p><hr><h3>4. Existing Customers</h3><p>Commission is <strong>not payable</strong> for:</p><ul><li><p>Orders placed by existing Aromantic customers who already have an account or prior purchase history.</p></li><li><p>Customers using affiliate links or codes after already being part of Aromantic’s customer database.</p></li></ul><p>Any such transactions will be automatically excluded from commission calculations.</p><hr><h3>5. Commissions and Payments</h3><p>Commissions are calculated on product value only and exclude VAT, shipping, discounts and other fees.</p><p>To receive payment:</p><ul><li><p>You must provide valid payment details in your dashboard.</p></li><li><p>Payments follow the schedule shown in the Affiliate Guide.</p></li></ul><p>Only successfully completed and non-refunded orders are eligible. Any refunded, cancelled or charged-back transactions will have commission removed.</p><p>We reserve the right to review any referral activity under our fair use policy.</p><hr><h3>6. Marketing Materials</h3><p>Approved banners, logos and promotional assets may be provided via the Marketing Tools section. You may use only official materials provided by Aromantic unless written approval is granted.</p><hr><h3>7. Network / Downline Affiliates</h3><p>Where enabled, affiliates may recruit downline affiliates using their network link.</p><ul><li><p>Downline affiliates earn their own commissions.</p></li><li><p>Upline affiliates earn network commission based on Aromantic’s current network settings.</p></li><li><p>Aromantic reserves the right to change or remove network commission structures at any time.</p></li></ul><hr><h3>8. Cookies and Tracking</h3><p>We use cookies to track affiliate referrals.</p><ul><li><p>If cookies are disabled, cleared or blocked, commissions cannot be tracked or paid.</p></li><li><p>Cookie duration is stated during registration.</p></li><li><p>During the cookie period, all orders from that customer are attributed to the affiliate unless another affiliate referral occurs.</p></li></ul><hr><h3>9. Removal from Programme</h3><p>Affiliates may request removal by emailing: <strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">info@aromantic.co.uk</a></strong></p><p>We reserve the right to remove any affiliate at any time without notice for breach of terms, misuse, fraud, or behaviour that may harm the Aromantic brand.</p><hr><h3>10. Final Notes</h3><p>We are delighted to have you as part of the Aromantic Affiliate Programme and wish you every success.</p><p>These Terms may be updated at any time. Continued participation confirms acceptance of the latest version.</p><p>For questions, contact: <strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">info@aromantic.co.uk</a></strong></p><div class=\"src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_c2dWrapper_v8pYg\"><br></div><p>     </p><div class=\"src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_arrow_pWfWX\"><div class=\"src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_innerArrow_L1vrh\"><br></div></div><p>   </p><p><br></p><p>\n      </p><div class=\"src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_c2dWrapper_v8pYg\">\n        \n        <div class=\"src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_callBtn_ZQO39 src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_visible_mEW3O\" title=\"Call with RingCentral\">\n          \n    \n\n\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_separatorLine_RYpwW src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_visible_mEW3O\"><br></div>\n        <div class=\"src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_textBtn_BlZA5 src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_visible_mEW3O\" title=\"SMS with RingCentral\">\n          \n    \n\n\n        </div></div>\n      <div class=\"src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_arrow_pWfWX\"><div class=\"src-widgets-BuiltinWidget-_styles_innerArrow_L1vrh\"><b